#: src/installation/kfmon.md:1
msgid "Using Cadmus with KFMon"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:3
msgid ""
"[KFMon](https://github.com/NiLuJe/kfmon) is a launcher that starts apps when "
"you open certain icon files on your Kobo. If you already use KFMon with "
"readers like Plato or KOReader, you may run into a conflict when you install "
"Cadmus."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:8
msgid "The problem"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:10
msgid ""
"KFMon watches PNG files in the library. When Cadmus opens one of those "
"watched PNG files — for example, while showing a cover or importing a book — "
"KFMon thinks you tapped the icon and launches the matching reader. This can "
"leave you with two readers running at the same time, such as both Plato and "
"Cadmus."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:15
msgid "The fix: add a Cadmus KFMon watch"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:17
msgid ""
"Add a KFMon watch that points to Cadmus. This tells KFMon about Cadmus, so "
"it blocks other launches while Cadmus is already running."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:20
msgid "Place the Cadmus icon somewhere on your Kobo, for example:"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:30
msgid ""
"If you don't have an icon, create or copy a PNG image to use as the launcher "
"icon."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:33
msgid "Create a new file on your Kobo:"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:43
msgid ""
"Paste this into the file, changing the `filename` value to match your icon "
"path:"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:69
msgid "Reboot your Kobo."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:72
msgid ""
"The `block_spawns = 1` line is the key setting. It stops KFMon from "
"launching another reader while Cadmus is already open."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:75
msgid "Pick one launcher method"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:77
msgid ""
"Cadmus can be launched by either NickelMenu or KFMon, but try to avoid both "
"at once. If you use KFMon, install a non-NickelMenu package from the "
"[Installation page](./index.md) (`KoboRoot.tgz` or `KoboRoot-test.tgz`) "
"instead of the `KoboRoot-nm.tgz` or `KoboRoot-nm-test.tgz` packages. Using "
"both can create duplicate icons and make conflicts harder to diagnose."
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:83
msgid "Temporarily disable KFMon"
msgstr ""

#: src/installation/kfmon.md:85
msgid ""
"If you need to stop KFMon from launching anything for a short time — for "
"example, while troubleshooting — you can create a blank `BLOCK` file:"
msgstr ""

