"When WiFi is set to **Auto**, Cadmus waits a short time after the last "
"network use before powering the radio down. Change that delay in the "
"[settings editor](ui/settings/index.md)."
msgstr ""

#: src/time-sync.md:3
msgid ""
"Cadmus can keep your Kobo's clock accurate by syncing it automatically "
"whenever WiFi connects."
msgstr ""

#: src/time-sync.md:6 src/auto-frontlight.md:6 src/soft-suspend.md:13
#: src/database-backup.md:5
