msgstr ""

#: src/time-sync.md:32
msgid ""
"By default Cadmus uses `time.cloudflare.com`. You can change this under "
"**Settings → General → NTP Server**, or in your settings file:"
msgstr ""

#: src/time-sync.md:43
msgid "The value is a hostname or IP address. NTP always uses port 123."
